# Google Sign-in
# 1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com
# 2. APIs & Services > OAuth consent screen > External > fill in name + email
# 3. APIs & Services > Credentials > Create Credentials > OAuth client ID > Web application
# 4. Add the app URL (e.g. http://localhost:8443) to "Authorized JavaScript origins"
# 5. Copy the Client ID below and restart the dev server
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
